{"ids":["joint-marginal","independence-factorization","covariance","covariance-matrix","sum-convolution"],"templates":{"joint-marginal":"<article class=\"card definition\" id=\"joint-marginal\" data-type=\"definition\" data-chapter=\"ch10\"><div class=\"card-kicker\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">定义</span><span class=\"lang-fr\" lang=\"fr\">Définition</span> <span class=\"lang-zh\">Loi jointe et lois marginales</span><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#joint-marginal\" aria-label=\"定位到联合分布与边缘分布\">#</a></div><h3><span class=\"lang-zh\">联合分布与边缘分布</span><span class=\"lang-fr\" lang=\"fr\">Définition 10.1 – Vecteur aléatoire</span></h3><div class=\"reading-columns\"><div class=\"zh-reading\" lang=\"zh-CN\" data-pane=\"joint-marginal:zh\"><div class=\"reading-label\">中文整合</div></div><div class=\"fr-reading\" lang=\"fr\" data-pane=\"joint-marginal:fr\"><div class=\"reading-label\">Français · Texte original</div></div></div><div class=\"card-meta\"><div class=\"sources\"><a href=\"../origin/按周划分/W4/Cours_ZFAI_L4_Theorie_de_la_mesure_et_probabilites_FR.pdf#page=116\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">W4 全学期课程手册</span><span class=\"lang-fr\" lang=\"fr\">Manuel de mesure et probabilités</span> · p. 116–117</a></div><div class=\"dependencies\"><span><span class=\"lang-zh\">依赖</span><span class=\"lang-fr\" lang=\"fr\">Prérequis</span></span><a class=\"dep-link\" href=\"#random-variable-law\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">随机变量就是可测函数</span><span class=\"lang-fr\" lang=\"fr\">Variable aléatoire et loi</span></a><a class=\"dep-link\" href=\"#generator-test\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">只需检验一组生成元</span><span class=\"lang-fr\" lang=\"fr\">Critère par générateurs</span></a><a class=\"dep-link\" href=\"#tonelli\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">Tonelli：非负函数可交换积分顺序</span><span class=\"lang-fr\" lang=\"fr\">Théorème de Tonelli</span></a></div><details class=\"tex-source\" data-state=\"source\"><summary>LaTeX 源文</summary><div class=\"lazy-detail\" data-content=\"joint-marginal:source\"></div></d